{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search for visible object, approach and pick it up, process and move to new location. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
